{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_073_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3e54ce4d654e2d53d17ed7511ef233d574ee0147994f575fe22c624043098983", "ja": "お疲れさま、のり子。\n……なんだか、機嫌がよさそうだな？", "zh": "辛苦了，纪子。\n……总觉得，你好像心情不错啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_073_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "79ed0bb5bde3a2350e8f19a357ee31c4ce0fc127c0af5b33d1244c7110ccf152", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nねえねえ、ブログのコメント見た？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n对了对了，你看过博客上的评论了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_073_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "239a808ecda94f74b833aa3ba2663d2bc3bb7496452c6d20e570dcd6aa2d2ca2", "ja": "新曲の感想がいっぱい来ててさ♪\nアタシの曲、なんだか元気が出るんだって。", "zh": "收到了好多对新歌的感想♪\n大家都说，听了我的歌好像会打起精神。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_073_1003_p", "source_sha256": "3bd9b2b9369d866afdbf7a24847bef89cfad6a8fe81634d2ebcdb20b684028a0", "ja": "そうだな。聞いていて、\n前向きな気持ちになる人が多かったみたいだ。", "zh": "是啊，听了之后，似乎有很多人都变得积极起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_073_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "dce9b8c201455b628f0253e60c2fdc2c3c2eb117b8270f097246589a52d413ea", "ja": "曲調とか、前と全然違うのに。\n元気になるってとこは、前の曲と同じ……。", "zh": "曲风什么的，跟以前完全不一样。\n但能让人振作起来这一点，跟以前的曲子一样……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_073_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "006ff01d7abd8e40bdb3ff487990b6ba13bb3751233e2b9578925e635c22c1a3", "ja": "……なんだか、1周まわって\n元に戻ってきたって感じがしない？", "zh": "……总觉得，是不是绕了1圈\n又转回原点了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_073_1006_p", "source_sha256": "61dbaf8de486009c68f7ae95fceada2a6b09573cb8b31b8545d150a27616d3f7", "ja": "だとしたら、それは変わらない\n『のり子らしさ』なのかもしれない。良かったな。", "zh": "如果真是这样，那或许就是始终不变的“法子风格”吧。那就太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_073_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "58f7b48d5839b9a917d3241ee8e234e7eb8f7e693c6ccc623bc7dc62d545c18f", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}。アタシ、何が\nアタシらしいか、自分でわかってるつもりだったけど。", "zh": "喂，{$P$}。我本来以为，自己知道什么才是属于我的风格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_073_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "860833bde04b83d7cba091e646a6476bf3150c5a108dc3196bcd497207552b75", "ja": "本当は、わかってなかったのかも。\n……ううん、今もわかってないかも。", "zh": "其实，我可能根本就不知道什么才是真正的自己。\n……不，也许直到现在也还是不知道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_073_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b5a38a0a040108ef0deee017a87400365457942d27171c31525e39c308466df0", "ja": "そうか……不安か？", "zh": "这样啊……你感到不安吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_073_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "fa7395bcd054691ffd8b11750e5d5c77412ce215e70e59499206472e17f497ff", "ja": "全然！　だってアタシがわからなくても、\n{$P$}がいてくれるでしょ？", "zh": "一点也不！因为就算我不知道，不是还有{$P$}在嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_073_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "ba5b5c7fd71fe3d26657d101b12e8d909508a02e5318843626152f22fdd917b9", "ja": "だから迷ったら、{$P$}に聞くよ。\nその時は、助けてよね！", "zh": "所以要是感到迷茫，我就去问{$P$}。\n到时候可要帮我哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_073_1012_p", "source_sha256": "8b0f74b8f6bb71cc551c724b46b3723b95e6e27244e8bae4b3b118a5f55fc517", "ja": "了解。……そうやって、素直に自分の気持ちを\n伝えられるところも、のり子らしさだな。", "zh": "明白了。……像这样能坦率地表达自己的心情，也是你的风格啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_073_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "1dd7ba43209e4993f0deb1b278c885d4b01da61907f41f916ab6c7391e9384bb", "ja": "えっ？　そう言われると、なんか\n恥ずかしくなってきたんだけど……。", "zh": "诶？你这么一说，我突然觉得有点不好意思了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_073_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "f31e74f0bd1782a2b878641431cca96f9d9df64d3309c71b447709fad71d11f2", "ja": "ううっ……{$P$}、\nこっち見ないで～！", "zh": "呜呜……{$P$}，\n别看我这边啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
